{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53936","headline":"五言美瓜沙僧献款诗一首 · 子言","name":"五言美瓜沙僧献款诗一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣泽布遐荒，僧来自远方。\n愿弘戎虏地，却作礼仪乡。\n博□谕乡雅，清谭义更长。\n□应恩意重，归路转生央。\n（见伯三八八六卷。\n原署：「右街千福寺沙门子言。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"子言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}